"or `\"memory\"`. `tap.voip.tcp_performance_mode` has tap-specific profile "
"names. See [Performance Optimization](../part5-advanced/performance.md#tcp-"
"performance-profiles)."
msgstr ""
"Perfil TCP de `sniff voip`: `\"balanced\"`, `\"throughput\"`, `\"latency\"` "
"o `\"memory\"`. `tap.voip.tcp_performance_mode` té noms de perfil específics "
"de Tap. Consulteu [optimització del rendiment](../part5-advanced/"
