#: src/part2-local-capture/watch-local.md:318
msgid "Toast Notifications"
msgstr "Notificacions emergents"

#: src/part2-local-capture/watch-local.md:320
msgid ""
"Status messages appear as toast notifications at the bottom of the screen, "
"auto-dismissing after 2-5 seconds. Types include success (green), error "
"(red), info (blue), and warning (yellow). Related toasts supersede each "
"other — for example, \"Paused\" is replaced by \"Resumed\"."
msgstr ""
"Els missatges d'estat apareixen com notificacions emergents a la part "
"inferior de la pantalla i desapareixen automàticament al cap de 2–5 segons. "
"Els tipus inclouen èxit (verd), error (vermell), informació (blau) i "
"advertiment (groc). Les notificacions relacionades se substitueixen entre "
"si; per exemple, \"Paused\" se substitueix per \"Resumed\"."

#: src/part2-local-capture/watch-local.md:322
msgid "Saving Packets"
msgstr "Desament de paquets"

#: src/part2-local-capture/watch-local.md:324
msgid ""
"Press `w` on the Capture tab to save displayed packets to a PCAP file. A "
"file dialog opens to choose the output path. Press `w` again to stop "
"streaming to the file."
msgstr ""
"Premeu `w` a la pestanya Capture per desar els paquets mostrats en un fitxer "
"PCAP. S'obre un diàleg de fitxer per triar el camí de sortida. Torneu a "
"prémer `w` per aturar l'escriptura contínua al fitxer."

#: src/part2-local-capture/watch-local.md:328
msgid ""
"Now that you're comfortable with local capture (CLI and TUI), you're ready "
"to learn about distributed capture in [Part III](../part3-distributed/"
"architecture.md) — where hunters capture at the edge and processors "
"aggregate centrally."
msgstr ""
"Ara que coneixeu la captura local (CLI i TUI), podeu aprendre sobre la "
"captura distribuïda a la [Part III](../part3-distributed/architecture.md), "
"on els nodes Hunter capturen a la perifèria i els processadors agreguen "
"centralment."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:3
msgid ""
"lippycat's distributed mode lets you capture traffic across multiple network "
"segments and aggregate it to a central point for analysis. This chapter "
"explains the architecture, when to use it, and how to choose the right "
"deployment topology."
msgstr ""
"El mode distribuït de lippycat permet capturar trànsit en diversos segments "
"de xarxa i agregar-lo en un punt central per analitzar-lo. Aquest capítol "
"explica l'arquitectura, quan utilitzar-la i com triar la topologia de "
"desplegament adequada."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:5
msgid "Why Distribute Capture?"
msgstr "Per què distribuir la captura?"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:7
msgid ""
"A single capture point only sees traffic on its own network segment. In real-"
"world networks, interesting traffic flows through multiple segments — data "
"centers, branch offices, DMZs, cloud regions. Distributed capture solves "
"three problems:"
msgstr ""
"Un únic punt de captura només veu el trànsit del seu segment de xarxa. En "
"xarxes reals, el trànsit d'interès passa per diversos segments: centres de "
"dades, sucursals, DMZ i regions del núvol. La captura distribuïda resol tres "
"problemes:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:9
msgid ""
"**Multi-segment visibility**: Deploy hunters wherever traffic flows. A "
"central processor aggregates everything into a single view."
msgstr ""
"**Visibilitat entre segments**: desplegueu nodes Hunter allà on passa el "
"trànsit. Un processador central ho agrega tot en una sola vista."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"**Scalability**: Spread capture load across many lightweight agents instead "
"of one overloaded machine."
msgstr ""
"**Escalabilitat**: repartiu la càrrega de captura entre molts agents "
"lleugers en lloc d'una màquina sobrecarregada."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:11
msgid ""
"**Separation of concerns**: Capture in restricted zones (DMZ, production), "
"analyze from a monitoring zone. Hunters need `CAP_NET_RAW`; the processor "
"doesn't."
msgstr ""
"**Separació de responsabilitats**: captureu en zones restringides (DMZ, "
"producció) i analitzeu des d'una zona de monitoratge. Els nodes Hunter "
"necessiten `CAP_NET_RAW`; el processador no."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:13
msgid "The Hunter/Processor Model"
msgstr "El model Hunter/processador"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:15
msgid "lippycat's distributed architecture has two node types:"
msgstr "L'arquitectura distribuïda de lippycat té dos tipus de node:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:17
msgid ""
"**Hunters** capture packets at the network edge and forward them to a "
"processor via gRPC. They're lightweight (~50MB RAM) and designed to run on "
"every network segment you want to monitor."
msgstr ""
"Els **nodes Hunter** capturen paquets a la perifèria de la xarxa i els "
"transmeten a un processador mitjançant gRPC. Són lleugers (~50 MB de RAM) i "
"estan dissenyats per funcionar en cada segment de xarxa que voleu supervisar."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:18
msgid ""
"**Processors** receive packets from multiple hunters, perform protocol "
"analysis, write PCAP files, and serve TUI clients for real-time monitoring."
msgstr ""
"Els **processadors** reben paquets de diversos nodes Hunter, fan anàlisi de "
"protocols, escriuen fitxers PCAP i atenen clients TUI per al monitoratge en "
"temps real."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:62
msgid ""
"**Data flow**: Hunters batch packets (default: 64 per batch) and stream them "
"to the processor over gRPC. The processor writes to PCAP, broadcasts to TUI "
"subscribers, injects into virtual interfaces, and optionally forwards "
"upstream."
msgstr ""
"**Flux de dades**: els nodes Hunter agrupen paquets en lots (per defecte: 64 "
"per lot) i els transmeten al processador per gRPC. El processador escriu "
"PCAP, difon als subscriptors TUI, injecta en interfícies virtuals i, "
"opcionalment, reenvia cap amunt."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:64
msgid "Packet and Event Forwarding"
msgstr "Reenviament de paquets i esdeveniments"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:66
msgid ""
"Each hunter or forwarding tap session uses one canonical upstream "
"representation:"
msgstr ""
"Cada sessió Hunter o Tap que reenvia utilitza una representació canònica cap "
"amunt:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:69
msgid "Analysis authority"
msgstr "Autoritat d'anàlisi"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:69
msgid "Central capabilities"
msgstr "Funcions centrals"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:69
#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:237 src/part5-advanced/security.md:13
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:69
msgid "Sent upstream"
msgstr "Enviat cap amunt"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:71
msgid "PCAP, packet views, virtual interface, reanalysis, normalized events"
msgstr ""
"PCAP, vistes de paquets, interfície virtual, nova anàlisi i esdeveniments "
"normalitzats"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:71
msgid "Processor"
msgstr "Processador"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:71
msgid "Selected raw packets"
msgstr "Paquets en brut seleccionats"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:71
msgid "`packets` (default)"
msgstr "`packets` (per defecte)"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:72
msgid "Event views, structured logs, and authorized metadata consumers"
msgstr ""
"Vistes d'esdeveniments, registres estructurats i consumidors de metadades "
"autoritzats"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:72
msgid "Hunter or tap"
msgstr "Hunter o Tap"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:72
msgid "Negotiated normalized metadata; no raw bytes or file content"
msgstr ""
"Metadades normalitzades negociades; sense bytes en brut ni contingut de "
"fitxers"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:72
msgid "`events`"
msgstr "`events`"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:74
msgid ""
"Event mode reduces bandwidth and raw-content exposure, but the receiver "
"cannot reconstruct packet evidence or repeat packet-dependent analysis. Use "
"a tap with local PCAP retention when both centralized metadata and edge "
"evidence are required. Event API and analysis capabilities are negotiated; "
"incompatibility fails closed unless the producer explicitly permits a logged "
"packet fallback. In hierarchical event mode, processors retain origin "
"identity and use a recoverable spool and acknowledgement boundary for each "
"forwarding hop."
msgstr ""
"El mode d'esdeveniments redueix l'amplada de banda i l'exposició de "
"contingut en brut, però el receptor no pot reconstruir proves de paquets ni "
"repetir anàlisis dependents de paquets. Utilitzeu un node Tap amb retenció "
"PCAP local quan calguin tant metadades centralitzades com proves a la "
"perifèria. L'API d'esdeveniments i les capacitats d'anàlisi es negocien; la "
"incompatibilitat provoca un tancament segur llevat que el productor permeti "
"explícitament un recurs a paquets que es registra. En mode d'esdeveniments "
"jeràrquic, els processadors conserven la identitat d'origen i utilitzen un "
"spool recuperable i un límit de confirmació per a cada salt de reenviament."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:82
msgid "There's also a third node type:"
msgstr "També hi ha un tercer tipus de node:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:84
msgid ""
"**Tap** combines hunter and processor in a single process. It captures "
"locally and provides all processor capabilities without gRPC overhead "
"between capture and processing. See [Chapter 9](tap.md) for details."
msgstr ""
"**Tap** combina Hunter i processador en un sol procés. Captura localment i "
"ofereix totes les funcions del processador sense la sobrecàrrega gRPC entre "
"captura i processament. Consulteu el [Capítol 9](tap.md) per obtenir més "
"detalls."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:86
msgid "Network Topologies"
msgstr "Topologies de xarxa"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:88
msgid "Hub-and-Spoke"
msgstr "Radial"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:90
msgid "The simplest topology. All hunters connect directly to one processor:"
msgstr ""
"La topologia més senzilla. Tots els nodes Hunter es connecten directament a "
"un processador:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:108
msgid ""
"**When to use**: Small to medium deployments (up to ~50 hunters), single "
"site, simple requirements."
msgstr ""
"**Quan utilitzar-la**: desplegaments petits o mitjans (fins a ~50 nodes "
"Hunter), un sol emplaçament i requisits senzills."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:110
msgid "Processor:"
msgstr "Processador:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:119
msgid "Hunters:"
msgstr "Nodes Hunter:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:127
msgid "Hierarchical"
msgstr "Jeràrquica"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:129
msgid ""
"Multi-tier architecture for geographic or network segmentation. Edge "
"processors aggregate locally and forward to regional or central processors:"
msgstr ""
"Arquitectura de diversos nivells per a segmentació geogràfica o de xarxa. "
"Els processadors de perifèria agreguen localment i reenvien a processadors "
"regionals o centrals:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:150
msgid ""
"**When to use**: Multi-site deployments, geographic distribution, DMZ/"
"internal segmentation, gradual aggregation with filtering at each tier."
msgstr ""
"**Quan utilitzar-la**: desplegaments en diversos emplaçaments, distribució "
"geogràfica, segmentació DMZ/interna i agregació gradual amb filtratge a cada "
"nivell."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:152
msgid "Central processor:"
msgstr "Processador central:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:161
msgid "Regional processor (forwards to central):"
msgstr "Processador regional (reenvia al central):"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:170
msgid "Edge processor (forwards to regional):"
msgstr "Processador de perifèria (reenvia al regional):"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:179
msgid ""
"Hierarchy depth is limited to 10 levels. Keep it at 3 or fewer for optimal "
"performance (each hop adds ~500ms to management operations)."
msgstr ""
"La profunditat de la jerarquia està limitada a 10 nivells. Manteniu-la en 3 "
"o menys per obtenir un rendiment òptim (cada salt afegeix ~500 ms a les "
"operacions de gestió)."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:181
msgid "Multi-Processor"
msgstr "Diversos processadors"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:183
msgid ""
"Distribute hunters across multiple independent processors for load "
"distribution:"
msgstr ""
"Repartiu els nodes Hunter entre diversos processadors independents per "
"distribuir la càrrega:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:194
msgid ""
"**When to use**: Very large deployments where a single processor can't "
"handle all traffic, or when you want independent monitoring domains."
msgstr ""
"**Quan utilitzar-la**: desplegaments molt grans on un sol processador no pot "
"gestionar tot el trànsit, o quan voleu dominis de monitoratge independents."

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:196
msgid "DMZ Segmentation"
msgstr "Segmentació DMZ"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:198
msgid ""
"Capture from both DMZ and internal networks using hierarchical forwarding "
"through the firewall:"
msgstr ""
"Capturar tant de la DMZ com de xarxes internes mitjançant reenviament "
"jeràrquic a través del tallafoc:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:223
msgid ""
"The DMZ processor forwards aggregated traffic through a single firewall port "
"to the internal processor, which merges it with internal captures. This "
"means:"
msgstr ""
"El processador DMZ reenvia el trànsit agregat a través d'un únic port del "
"tallafoc al processador intern, que el combina amb les captures internes. "
"Això significa:"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:225
msgid "Hunters in the DMZ never need direct access to the internal network"
msgstr ""
"Els nodes Hunter de la DMZ mai no necessiten accés directe a la xarxa interna"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:226
msgid ""
"Only one firewall rule is needed (DMZ processor → internal processor on port "
"55555)"
msgstr ""
"Només cal una regla de tallafoc (processador DMZ → processador intern al "
"port 55555)"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:227
msgid "The internal processor has a unified view of both zones"
msgstr "El processador intern té una vista unificada de totes dues zones"

#: src/part3-distributed/architecture.md:229
msgid ""
"**When to use**: Security-sensitive environments where capture spans trust "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""
"**Quan utilitzar-la**: entorns sensibles a la seguretat on la captura "
"travessa límits de confiança."

