msgstr "Gestió de subscripcions a Hunters"

#: src/part4-administration/watch-remote.md:258
msgid ""
"By default, connecting to a processor streams packets from all its hunters. "
"Hunter subscriptions let you focus on specific network segments."
msgstr ""
"Per defecte, en connectar-vos a un processador es transmeten els paquets de "
"tots els seus Hunters. Les subscripcions a Hunters us permeten centrar-vos "
