"One HTTP transaction observation. `trans_depth` orders transactions on a "
"connection. Request/response columns describe method, authority and URI, "
"selected standard headers, version, observed body lengths, response status "
"and informational response. `tags` and `proxied` carry analyzer/proxy "
"annotations; file vectors join to `files.log`. `password` is not collected "
"by default."
