#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid ""
"When something goes wrong during a capture, you need answers quickly. This "
"chapter organizes common problems by category, each following the same "
"structure: what you see (symptom), why it happens (cause), and what to do "
"about it (solution). Diagnostic commands are included so you can confirm the "
"root cause before applying a fix."
msgstr ""
"Quan alguna cosa falla durant una captura, cal obtenir respostes ràpidament. "
"Aquest capítol organitza els problemes habituals per categories, totes amb "
"la mateixa estructura: què observeu (símptoma), per què passa (causa) i què "
"podeu fer-hi (solució). S’inclouen ordres de diagnòstic per confirmar la "
"causa arrel abans d’aplicar una correcció."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:5
msgid ""
"If you have not yet read [Chapter 12: Operations Runbook](../part4-"
"administration/operations.md), start there for health checks and monitoring "
"scripts. This chapter goes deeper into specific failure modes."
msgstr ""
"Si encara no heu llegit el [Capítol 12: Guia d’operacions](../part4-"
"administration/operations.md), comenceu-hi per trobar comprovacions d’estat "
"i scripts de supervisió. Aquest capítol aprofundeix en modes de fallada "
"específics."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:7
msgid "Capture Issues"
msgstr "Problemes de captura"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid "These problems affect all capture modes — `sniff`, `hunt`, and `tap`."
msgstr ""
"Aquests problemes afecten tots els modes de captura: `sniff`, `hunt` i `tap`."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "Permission Denied"
msgstr "Permís denegat"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid ""
"**Symptom:** lippycat exits immediately with `operation not permitted` or "
"`permission denied`."
msgstr ""
"**Símptoma:** lippycat es tanca immediatament amb `operation not permitted` "
"o `permission denied`."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Live packet capture requires the `CAP_NET_RAW` and "
"`CAP_NET_ADMIN` Linux capabilities. Without them, the kernel refuses access "
"to the network interface."
msgstr ""
"**Causa:** la captura de paquets en directe requereix les capacitats Linux "
"`CAP_NET_RAW` i `CAP_NET_ADMIN`. Sense aquestes capacitats, el nucli denega "
"l’accés a la interfície de xarxa."

