#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:114
msgid "No Packets Captured"
msgstr "No es capturen paquets"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:116
msgid "**Symptom:** lippycat starts without error but shows zero packets."
msgstr "**Símptoma:** lippycat s’inicia sense errors però mostra zero paquets."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:118
msgid "**Cause:** Several possibilities:"
msgstr "**Causa:** hi ha diverses possibilitats:"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:120
msgid ""
"**Wrong interface** — traffic flows through a different interface than the "
"one selected."
msgstr ""
"**Interfície incorrecta**: el trànsit passa per una interfície diferent de "
"la seleccionada."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:121
msgid ""
"**BPF filter too restrictive** — the filter expression excludes the traffic "
"you expect."
msgstr ""
"**Filtre BPF massa restrictiu**: l’expressió del filtre exclou el trànsit "
"que espereu."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:122
msgid ""
"**Firewall rules** — iptables or nftables is dropping packets before they "
"reach the capture layer."
msgstr ""
"**Regles del tallafoc**: iptables o nftables descarta paquets abans que "
"arribin a la capa de captura."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:123
msgid ""
"**Promiscuous mode needed** — the traffic is not addressed to this host and "
"the interface is not in promiscuous mode."
msgstr ""
"**Cal mode promiscu**: el trànsit no s’adreça a aquest amfitrió i la "
"interfície no està en mode promiscu."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:127
msgid "Confirm traffic exists on the interface with tcpdump:"
msgstr "Confirmeu amb tcpdump que hi ha trànsit a la interfície:"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:135
msgid "If capturing VoIP, check for SIP traffic specifically:"
msgstr "Si captureu VoIP, comproveu específicament el trànsit SIP:"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:151
msgid "For nftables:"
msgstr "Per a nftables:"

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:161
msgid ""
"If `tcpdump` sees traffic but lippycat does not, check your BPF filter. "
"Start without a filter and add constraints incrementally."
msgstr ""
"Si `tcpdump` veu trànsit però lippycat no, comproveu el filtre BPF. Comenceu "
"sense filtre i afegiu restriccions gradualment."

#: src/part5-advanced/troubleshooting.md:162
